# <namespace>/<claim><TAB><reason> for each folly claim that no backup covers on purpose.
default/hajimari-config	empty; Hajimari reads its settings from a ConfigMap
dump/dump-data-dump-nfs-0	scratch space for file drops
kthx-datastores/valkey-applol-cache-0-0-data	cache; the kthx engine owns the Datastore
monitoring/prometheus-prom-stack-kube-prometheus-db-prometheus-prom-stack-kube-prometheus-0	metrics history; rules and dashboards come from git
monitoring/server-volume-victoria-logs-server-0	log history; rebuilds from new logs
monitoring/storage-tempo-0	trace history; rebuilds from new traces
nfs-provisioner/pvc-nfs-provisioner-nfs-subdir-external-provisioner	mount handle for the NFS export; the data lives on spore
